t\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cold_Iron\" title=\"Cold Iron\">Cold Iron</a>:</b> This iron mined deep underground, known for its effectiveness against fey creatures, is forged at a lower temperature to preserve its delicate properties. When combined with <a href=\"/page/Good_aligned\" title=\"Good aligned\">Good</a> damage types, Cold Iron weapons are able to overcome the <a href=\"/page/Damage_reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage reduction\">damage reduction</a> of most <a href=\"/page/Demon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Demon\">Demons</a> like <a href=\"/page/Fire_Reaver\" title=\"Fire Reaver\">Fire Reavers</a> or <a href=\"/page/Flesh_Render\" title=\"Flesh Render\">Flesh Renders</a>. See <a href=\"/page/Monster_DR_and_weaknesses\" title=\"Monster DR and weaknesses\">Monster DR and weaknesses</a> for specifics.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0004001500</span>4,001<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">4 lbs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/A_Relic_of_a_Sovereign_Past\" title=\"A Relic of a Sovereign Past\">A Relic of a Sovereign Past</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cold_Iron\" title=\"Cold Iron\">Cold Iron</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cold_Iron\" title=\"Cold Iron\">Cold Iron</a>:</b> This iron mined deep underground, known for its effectiveness against fey creatures, is forged at a lower temperature to preserve its delicate properties. When combined with <a href=\"/page/Good_aligned\" title=\"Good aligned\">Good</a> damage types, Cold Iron weapons are able to overcome the <a href=\"/page/Damage_reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage reduction\">damage reduction</a> of most <a href=\"/page/Demon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Demon\">Demons</a> like <a href=\"/page/Fire_Reaver\" title=\"Fire Reaver\">Fire Reavers</a> or <a href=\"/page/Flesh_Render\" title=\"Flesh Render\">Flesh Renders</a>. See <a href=\"/page/Monster_DR_and_weaknesses\" title=\"Monster DR and weaknesses\">Monster DR and weaknesses</a> for specifics.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\">  Vorpal</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\">  Vorpal</a>:</b> Passive: <a href=\"/page/Weapon_dice_multiplier\" title=\"Weapon dice multiplier\">+0.5[W]</a> damage dice.<br />On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: If your target has fewer than 1000 Hit Points, they are instantly slain. If your target has above 1000 Hit Points, they take 100 damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Pure_Good\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pure Good\">Pure Good</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Pure_Good\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pure Good\">Pure Good</a>:</b> This weapon is infused with the power of Pure Good. It does an additional 1 to 6 damage to non-good targets and can only be wielded by Good-aligned characters.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Tesyus.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Tesyus.png/420px-Tesyus.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"557\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Tesyus.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The Sovereign Host's fabled sword, Tesyus.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>This is an in-quest only item and drops upon leaving the adventure. It is not possible to use a Mirror of Glamering on this item.</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/page/Item:Flametongue\" title=\"Item:Flametongue\">Flametongue</a> uses the same model, you have to replace the fiery aura with one of your choosing, for example holy. <span class=\"citation\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ddovault.com/cgi-bin/yabb2/YaBB.pl?num=1502147151/75#75\">DDO Vault</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817231145\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.152 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5589/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35425/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11062/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 33/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n101.94%  136.123     56 Template:IO\n100.00%  133.527      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  133.527      1 -total\n 97.28%  129.898      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 35.15%   46.939      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 34.03%   45.446      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 32.47%   43.358      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.64%   42.242      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.26%   28.384      2 Template:Mat\n 21.17%   28.267      7 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:17699-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817231145 and revision id 635272. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
